  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOLIDAY SPECIAL!! $100 GROCERY DELIVERY CREDIT:<br>Let us help you celebrate for the holidays! For NEW reservations made after Nov 9th with check-in date being during the timeframes of November 10th, 2025- January 5th, 2026 you will receive $100 credit towards grocery delivery!<br>Here is how it works: After you book the property we will email you a link to order groceries for your stay with a promo code that will give you $100 off your order! Our shoppers will shop your order, deliver it to the property and have it put away before you arrive!<br><br>KEY HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- 6-passenger Golf Cart <br>- Less than a 3-minute walk to the beach<br>- Santa Clara beach access is ADA accessible via ramp and has parking, restrooms, and lifeguards during peak season<br>- Large heated pool and sitting spa **Pool heating available October 1–May 1 for $55 per day / Pool & Sitting Spa are heated together**<br>- Sleeps 30 in beds (no pullout beds needed)!<br>- Game room with arcade games<br>- 2-minute drive to Publix in WaterColor Shopping Center<br>- Short bike ride to Seaside or favorite local restaurants, Café 30A, Surfing Deer, and Market Cafe<br>- bikes<br>- Tesla Charging Station<br>- Grocery Delivery available<br><br>\"Waves\" GOLF CART, SLEEPS 30, PRIVATE HEATED POOL, 8 BEDS/8.5 BATHS, AND JUST 1 BLOCK FROM THE BEACH, GAME ROOM & TESLA CHARGER!<br>Experience the luxurious comfort of Waves, a stunning 8-bedroom, 8.5-bathroom retreat located in Seagrove Beach. This exquisite home accommodates up to 30 guests and offers a plethora of amenities to ensure a remarkable stay. Just a short 3-minute walk away, you'll find easy beach access, allowing you to sink your toes into the sand and embrace the coastal beauty. This home does come equipped with a Tesla charger!<br>Waves features a private pool with a convenient sitting spa, perfect for unwinding and soaking up the sun. The expansive game room on the third floor guarantees endless entertainment with its air hockey table, foosball table, vintage arcade game, and two game-ready 44\" TVs. Snuggle up on the comfortable wrap-around sofas, mix drinks at the wet bar, and savor snacks at the two large dining tables. For a breath of fresh air, step onto the spacious balcony and revel in the picturesque views of Seagrove Beach.<br>The first floor of Waves boasts a guest bedroom furnished with a king bed, complete with a private bathroom featuring a shower/tub combo. The open-concept living, dining, and kitchen areas offer a seamless flow and overlook the inviting pool. The gourmet kitchen is a chef's dream, equipped with premium appliances, including 2 Fisher & Paykel refrigerators, 2 dishwashers, and a 5-burner gas cooktop. The island with seating for 3 provides a cozy spot for casual conversations. Adjacent to the kitchen, the living area showcases two wrap-around sofas facing a 65\" Roku TV, creating the perfect spot for relaxation. Additionally, two dining tables, each seating 8 guests, are nestled behind the sofas. French doors lead to a covered porch featuring dining tables and an outdoor kitchen with a convenient gas grill. Lounge on the chaise lounge chairs surrounding the beautiful pool, which boasts a wide sun shelf and a sitting spa.<br>The second floor is home to four guest bedrooms, each offering a private bathroom, a flat-screen TV, and a balcony overlooking the pool. These cozy retreats provide a tranquil haven for relaxation and rejuvenation.<br>With bikes, guests can effortlessly explore the charming towns of Seaside and Seagrove Beach. With its close proximity to public beach access, a spacious pool, and a home thoughtfully designed for both relaxation and amusement, Waves is sure to be in high demand. Secure your reservation quickly to ensure an unforgettable coastal getaway.<br>**Pool Heat is available Oct 1st - May 31st and can be added for an additional $55/day. Please note that the sitting spa is not heated unless you pay for pool heat as it is all on one heater.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS:<br>Take a short 2-3 minute stroll across 30A, and you'll find yourself at one of the best beach access locations along Hwy 30A. The Santa Clara beach access has ample parking for cars, golf carts, and bikes, as well as clean restrooms and a lifeguard stand.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 30):<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Tub/Shower Combo<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed and Twin-over-Twin Bunk Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed and Twin over Twin Bunk Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>- Guest Bedroom: Twin over Twin Bunk Bed and Queen over Queen Bunk Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Guest Bedroom: Two Queen over Queen Bunk Beds, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>DISCLAIMER: <br>We are a professional Vacation Rental Company and will require you to sign a rental agreement when booking with us. We will contact you to get this emailed over shortly after you book. Please also note, that if the property comes with a golf cart or you rent one through our company then you will also be required to sign a Golf Cart Waiver as well. If you have any questions please feel free to message us.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Seagrove - 1 Block from Beach, Golf Cart, Private HEATED Pool, Game Room, Bikes & Tesla Charger!"
        }
      ],
